<p class="summary">Web platform owner who takes a site from legacy to modern and keeps it running: strategy, architecture, build, QA, launch, and governance. Twelve years at Classic Vacations (Expedia Group); maintained and published on the company's Drupal platform, then led its modernization onto WordPress as the sole web resource: designed the content architecture, built the template system, integrated third-party property data, and guided six-plus distributed content contributors across Marketing and Solutions so publishing no longer waited on a developer. Pre-launch QA discipline from nine years in product operations. Leads the evaluation and adoption of AI-enabled tools and automation in web work: AI-assisted development (Claude, Cursor, Codex) as a production practice since 2023, agentic workflows and MCP integrations, and sites built to be discoverable by AI search and agents (GEO/AEO, WebMCP, structured data); recognized by management for bringing AI into the team's workflow. Reported to the VP of Technology &amp; Operations.</p>

