  <span class="skill-cat">Agentic AI</span><span class="skill-val">Builds and teaches agentic systems: Claude Code, MCP servers and WebMCP, OpenClaw and Hermes agent orchestration, agent memory files (CLAUDE.md / AGENTS.md), structured prompting; AI-assisted development (Claude, Cursor, Codex) as a production practice since 2023; human review kept in the loop</span>
